OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered showers will
OL,6,Fgradually die out through the morning
OL,7,Fto leave dry conditions developing
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon. Mostly cloudy
OL,9,Fin the morning with some bright
OL,10,Fspells, longer sunny spells breaking
OL,11,Fthrough in the afternoon. Fresh
OL,12,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FIt will be dry through the
OL,15,Fevening and overnight. Mostly cloudy
OL,16,Fbut with some clear intervals. Winds
OL,17,Fturning southeasterly overnight and
OL,18,Fstrengthening over the Western Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
