OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA dry morning with bright
OL,6,Fspells. Turning increasingly cloudy
OL,7,Fthrough the afternoon with some light
OL,8,Frain possible in the south later.
OL,9,FSoutheasterly winds becoming strong
OL,10,Fwith gales over Western Isles.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,13,Fspreading east Wednesday, then sunny
OL,14,Fspells and showers, strong winds with
OL,15,Fgales or severe gales in west. Bright
OL,16,Fspells and showers Thursday, strong
OL,17,Fwinds easing. Cloudy with rain Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
